{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>那曲市7級地震　啟動國家地震災害4級應急響應</strong></p><p>・那曲市發生7級地震<br>・國家啟動4級應急響應<br>・地震災害級別較高<br>・需密切關注傷亡情況<br>・啟動應急救援機制</p><p>暫時未能從東網 本地擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261023/bkn-20261023000622818-1023_00822_001.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:36.865019+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T16:06:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.239897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.239897+00:00","content_hash":"5ac8ebd7bda909b14ffdd111c6a1838e6759bcbbeb7e40b4cc876a6f8e753992","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}